 "about": "Cases for the sound alerts, read by both OzenKitTests (SoundAlertsSharedCasesTests, Swift) and core SoundAlertsSharedCasesTest (Kotlin). catalog is SoundEventCatalog.events in order (importance 0 low to 3 critical; sameSoundAs is the cooldown key; the names in Hebrew and English); listed, vibrationLookalikes and sustained are the catalog's lists. sequences replay SoundEventPolicy, from the default policy and preferences with the fields given changed: each hear step is [identifier, confidence, timestamp] and the alert's identifier or null, a reset step is resetCooldowns. matching is SoundEventCatalog.matchingObservations (expected [identifier, confidence] in order). banners is SoundAlert.takesBanner and bannerSeconds; gate is SoundAlertGate.pass in sequence, giving the lengths of the chunks passed on.",
